[PrintTextModified Text:谁！？|#0102Adv29_Nanoka006| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香感到树丛那边有人走了过来，<br>便猛地回过头。|#0102Adv29_Narrative039| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideActors ActorIds:Nanoka-Front,MainBackground-Front Lazy:false
@SpawnBlur ActorId:MainBackground-Front Intensity:0 FadeDuration:0
@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:MaskingRectangle SubId:Front LogWarning:true
@Wait WaitMode:0.3

[PrintTextModified Text:这里无比黑暗。|#0102Adv29_Narrative040| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:只有从树林间隙透过的微弱月光<br>照亮了奈叶香。|#0102Adv29_Narrative041| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:现在是少女们的禁止外出时间。<br>奈叶香眼里带着十二分的警惕，<br>架好手里的枪。|#0102Adv29_Narrative042| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Jailer.1

[PrintTextModified Text:等了一会，<br>看守来到奈叶香的面前。|#0102Adv29_Narrative043| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0102Adv29_Jailer001| AuthorId:Jailer RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:即便看到奈叶香，看守也无动于衷，<br>直接默不作声地离开了。|#0102Adv29_Narrative044| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这已经不知是第几次放过她了。<br>奈叶香自嘲地笑了笑。|#0102Adv29_Narrative045| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 鉄製の扉を開く音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_62 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

