[PrintTextModified Text:她走进藏身地，<br>头靠在门上自言自语道。|#0102Adv29_Narrative046| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:我迟早会变成“那边”的人。等我。|#0102Adv29_Nanoka007| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

